OL,3,AFBI investigating claim hackers have
OL,4,Astolen details of all its agents
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe FBI is investigating a claim by a
OL,7,Fcyber-crime group that it has stolen
OL,8,Fsensitive information on all bureau
OL,9,Fstaff - around 38,000 people.
OL,11,FThe group, Shiny Hunters, says it has
OL,12,Fevery agent's name, role, badge number
OL,13,Fand personal details including home
OL,14,Faddress, phone numbers and spouse
OL,15,Finformation.
OL,17,FProfessor Ciaran Martin, the former
OL,18,Fhead of the UK's National Cyber
OL,19,FSecurity Centre, said - if confirmed -
OL,20,Fit was "as serious as it gets when it
OL,21,Fcomes to data breaches."
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
